/**
 *  Aeotec Smart Switch Gen5 (ZW075) - Hubitat
 *
 *  Version 1.0.1
 *
 *  Based on the published Aeotec Smart Switch Gen5 (ZW075) V3.26
 *  engineering specification, adapted for Hubitat.
 *
 *  Key features:
 *  - Independent report selections for Groups 1, 2 and 3 (101/102/103)
 *  - Independent report intervals for Groups 1, 2 and 3 (111/112/113)
 *  - Groups 2 and 3 collapse when Disabled
 *  - Threshold controls (90/91/92)
 *  - Load-change notification control (80)
 *  - LED mode control (81)
 *  - Set -> Get verification for configuration parameters
 *  - Configure/Save configuration readbacks are DEBUG only
 *  - Manual "Check Parameters" command logs readbacks at INFO
 *  - Manual "Check Device Info" command logs manufacturer/model IDs at INFO
 *
 *  Report bit masks (Parameters 101-103):
 *      1 = Voltage
 *      2 = Current (Amperes)
 *      4 = Watts
 *      8 = Accumulated kWh
 */

